Subject: [PATCH 087/147] =?UTF-8?q?fix(sources):=20genSources=20=E8=A1=A5?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E4=B8=8A=20intermediary=20=E4=BA=A7=E7=89=A9=E7=9A=84=E4=BE=9D?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E8=B5=96=EF=BC=8C=E4=BF=AE=20DecompileTest=20=E7=A1=AC?=
